# Loft (an extension): with the top square's sketch active, New Group >
# Loft To Selected Profile with nothing selected says what to select;
# with a line of the bottom square picked, the two squares are joined by
# ruled faces, and the group screen lists the profiles and the turn.
# Analyze > Check Solid finds the frustum sound; [+1] turns the second
# profile by one curve, a quarter turn, and the faces become saddles,
# still sound; [-1] turns it back.
file $testdata/ui/loft_profiles.spcs
menu File|Open...
view default
answer ok
menu New Group|Loft To Selected Profile
move 300 400
down L 300 400
up L 300 400
menu New Group|Loft To Selected Profile
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 280 165
twdown L 280 165
twup L 280 165
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 235 165
twdown L 235 165
twup L 235 165
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
